WEBVTT

00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:12,030
When I lie down and my head is on the pillow,

00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:14,930
I feel light headed and feel like I'm moving.

00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:18,470
Can this be iron or red blood cell deficiency?

00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:23,030
It certainly can be a Nebia.

00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:28,030
So getting a CBC would be in order just to test from that.

00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:37,930
That would be, that would be number one.

00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:40,970
Number two would be blood sugar issues.

00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:43,470
So if you just have a blue cometer at home,

00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:46,630
make sure you're testing your blood glucose levels

00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:49,230
to make sure you don't have hypoglycemia.

00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:56,740
Those would be the two biggies that I would look for.

00:00:56,740 --> 00:01:00,540
So get that going and let's see what's going on.

00:01:06,010 --> 00:01:08,010
The other thing you can't happen is you got to,

00:01:08,010 --> 00:01:12,110
you know, if it's truly dizzy and you feel like you're spitting,

00:01:12,110 --> 00:01:23,110
you could have issues with your inner canals and your beer.

00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:27,110
That could be an issue too, but it doesn't sound like you're spitting.

